ing is  supposed to be given by lunar princess  Ronnie to her consort Ronnie is an  empyrean meaning her consort with by  right earn the title of Lord a warning  is engraved within whoever thou mayest  be take not the ring from this place the  Solitude beyond the night is better mine  alone so this kind of suggests that  Ronnie doesn't really care either way if  someone like us became her consort and  then became Lord alongside with her  she's wanting to usher in an entirely  New Era and change what has been under  the influence of the greater will  whether we join her or not doesn't make  a difference to her but at least we  aren't technically maidenless anymore so  that's great she leaves her doll here  just in case we do wish to take on the  role as her consort we give her the ring  and she's sort of surprised that it was  us who would go all of this way for her  and what she desires  who would become my Lord  perhaps I needn't have warned Thee I am  pleased however  thou art a fit in Choice during Ronnie's  ending we can see the new era of  darkness she ushers in under the power  of the full moon there seems to be a lot  of mistranslations about what this  exactly means but what I think is the  main thing to understand about Ronnie's  ending and what her fate and destiny  truly is is that what Ronnie wants is to  change the world and get rid of the  greater Will's influence  so hopefully this video helped you guys  understand a bit better why radon was  holding back the stars and how Ronnie's  fate was tied to it another special  thank you to my patrons who helped  support this channel they get early  access to videos with no ads at all so  if you're interested in supporting the  Channel with some pretty cool benefits  check out my patreon which is linked in  the description along with all of my  other socials I'd appreciate it if you  gave them a follow thank you all for  watching the video and I will see you in  the next one take care  [Music]

